# The cassette must build byte for byte the same on every host. The manuals in
# src/zx-ux/*.doc are copied into its file system as they are, so a CRLF checkout
# (Windows autocrlf) would make a different, larger tape. Keep text as LF.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.bin binary
*.rom binary
*.xz binary
sjasmplus-*-linux-amd64 binary
